eading" data-v-e8ad8468><div data-v-e8ad8468><p class="eyebrow" data-v-e8ad8468>Available tools</p><h2 data-v-e8ad8468>Providers in Branding.</h2></div><p data-v-e8ad8468>Each provider is one tool the plugin can use. Open a provider to see its listed actions, availability limits, and official product links.</p></div><div class="plugin-provider-grid" data-v-e8ad8468><!--[--><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ff8a68;" data-v-e8ad8468 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ff8a68;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/channel-metrics.svg" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Branding</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/channel-metrics/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Channel Metrics</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Provider-neutral metrics contract for channel-native outcome snapshots.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Outcome Learning</span><!--]--><!----></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/channel-metrics/" class="" data-v-480388d2>1 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://developers.google.com/analytics" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ff8a68;" data-v-e8ad8468 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ff8a68;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/email-service-provider.svg" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Branding</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/esp/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Email Service Provider</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Provider-agnostic ESP contract for digest or standalone authority emails with list management, opt-in, unsubscribe, and metrics owned by the ESP.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Content Distribution</span><!--]--><!----></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/esp/" class="" data-v-480388d2>1 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://resend.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ff8a68;" data-v-e8ad8468 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style="--mark-color:#ff8a68;" aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2 data-v-aa7c01f7><img src="/images/integrations/git-icon.png" alt="" data-v-aa7c01f7></span><span data-v-480388d2>Branding</span></div><a href="/library/integrations/git-remote/" class="integration-card__body" data-v-480388d2><h2 data-v-480388d2>Git Remote</h2><p data-v-480388d2>Git-backed canonical publishing target for static sites or repository-rendered blogs.</p></a><div class="integration-card__capabilities" data-v-480388d2><!--[--><span data-v-480388d2>Content Distribution</span><!--]--><!----></div><footer data-v-480388d2><a href="/library/integrations/git-remote/" class="" data-v-480388d2>1 actions <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>→</span></a><a href="https://git-scm.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-v-480388d2> Visit tool <span aria-hidden="true" data-v-480388d2>↗</span></a></footer></article><article class="integration-card" style="--integration-color:#ff8a68;" data-v-e8ad8468 data-v-480388d2><div class="integration-card__top" data-v-480388d2><span class="integration-mark is-small has-logo" style=